plans
audit-report-full.html

# Local screenshots from scripts/nav-shot.ts (throwaway dev output)
.nav-shot/

# Windows PowerShell module cache (machine noise, never project content)
Microsoft/

# Throwaway one-off probes at the repo root (e.g. .tmp-icon-audit.ts). Biome
# honours this file, so an untracked probe would otherwise fail `bun run check`
# for reasons that have nothing to do with the code under review. Anchored to
# the root on purpose: a scratch file inside src/ is still a source file, and a
# nested `.tmp-*` there should keep failing the gate until it is removed.
/.tmp-*
_old_flat.json
